        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\sqrt3\\sin2x-\\cos2x=2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac\\pi3,\\dfrac{4\\pi}{3}$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt3\\sin2x-\\cos2x&=2\\\\2\\sin\\left(2x-\\frac\\pi6\\right)&=2\\\\\\sin\\left(2x-\\frac\\pi6\\right)&=1\\end{aligned}$$\nThe transformed domain is $-\\dfrac\\pi6\\le2x-\\dfrac\\pi6\\le\\dfrac{23\\pi}{6}$, so\n$$\\begin{aligned}2x-\\frac\\pi6&=\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{5\\pi}{2}\\\\2x&=\\frac{2\\pi}{3},\\frac{8\\pi}{3}\\\\x&=\\frac\\pi3,\\frac{4\\pi}{3}.\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q18-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\sin4x+\\cos4x=1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=0,\\dfrac\\pi8,\\dfrac\\pi2,\\dfrac{5\\pi}{8},\\pi,\\dfrac{9\\pi}{8},\\dfrac{3\\pi}{2},\\dfrac{13\\pi}{8},2\\pi$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\sin4x+\\cos4x&=1\\\\\\sqrt2\\sin\\left(4x+\\frac\\pi4\\right)&=1\\\\\\sin\\left(4x+\\frac\\pi4\\right)&=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\end{aligned}$$\nThe transformed domain is $\\dfrac\\pi4\\le4x+\\dfrac\\pi4\\le\\dfrac{33\\pi}{4}$, so\n$$\\begin{aligned}4x+\\frac\\pi4&=\\begin{gathered}\\frac\\pi4,\\frac{3\\pi}{4},\\frac{9\\pi}{4},\\frac{11\\pi}{4},\\frac{17\\pi}{4},\\\\\\frac{19\\pi}{4},\\frac{25\\pi}{4},\\frac{27\\pi}{4},\\frac{33\\pi}{4}\\end{gathered}\\\\4x&=\\begin{gathered}0,\\frac\\pi2,2\\pi,\\frac{5\\pi}{2},4\\pi,\\\\\\frac{9\\pi}{2},6\\pi,\\frac{13\\pi}{2},8\\pi\\end{gathered}\\\\x&=\\begin{gathered}0,\\frac\\pi8,\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{5\\pi}{8},\\pi,\\\\\\frac{9\\pi}{8},\\frac{3\\pi}{2},\\frac{13\\pi}{8},2\\pi.\\end{gathered}\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
